---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Book a recording session" description="Continue to Legacy Music Group’s existing booking calendar to choose a service, engineer and available time. Review the current price and terms before checkout."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your next session</p><h1>Get into<br /><em>the room.</em></h1><p>Choose your service and check available times in Legacy’s existing booking calendar.</p></header><div class="contact-grid"><section class="booking-panel"><h2>Book with Legacy.</h2><p>You’ll continue to legacymusicgroup.com. Reservations, personal details and payments are handled there.</p><a class="button primary booking-handoff" href={business.bookingUrl}>Open booking calendar <Arrow /></a><p class="small">Opening the calendar does not reserve a time. Look for confirmation after completing the booking process.</p><a class="text-link" href={`tel:${business.phone}`}>Questions? {business.displayPhone}</a></section><ol class="process-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Choose your setup.</h3><p>Select the service, session length and engineer. Use Any if you have no preference.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Choose your time.</h3><p>Browse available dates and times for your chosen session.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Review the details.</h3><p>Check the total and current recording terms before checkout. Your confirmation comes from Legacy’s booking system.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></Layout>
